From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Snowflake <wosnxn123@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 22:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Integrate Cesium-Folia storage backend

Routes chunk regions, player data, advancements, statistics, and saved data
through the opt-in Cesium storage manager. Keeps the vanilla filesystem path
unchanged while disabled and closes the Cesium commit pump during shutdown.

---
